 \n|  ![⟨65⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨66⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨67⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨68⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨69⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨70⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨71⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨72⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨73⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨74⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨75⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨76⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨77⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨78⟩]  |  \n|  ![⟨79⟩]  |  \n  * Overview⟨80⟩\n  * Dataset Structure⟨81⟩\n  * Coverage⟨82⟩\n    * States/UTs Covered (28+)⟨83⟩\n    * Document Formats⟨84⟩\n    * Conditions⟨85⟩\n    * Lighting⟨86⟩\n    * Angles⟨87⟩\n  * Metadata Fields⟨88⟩\n  * Generation Details⟨89⟩\n  * Intended Use⟨90⟩\n  * Limitations⟨91⟩\n  * License⟨92⟩\n  * Generated by ML Intern⟨93⟩\n  * Usage⟨94⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨95⟩ Synthetic Indian Driving License Image Dataset \n##   ⟨80⟩ Overview \nThis dataset contains **30 synthetic images** of Indian driving licenses generated using the Z-Image-Turbo⟨96⟩ diffusion model. The images cover a wide range of Indian states/UTs, document formats, lighting conditions, angles, and wear states — designed for training and evaluating document analysis, OCR, and classification models.\n##   ⟨81⟩ Dataset Structure \n\n```\nindian-dl-dataset/\n├── README.md\n├── metadata.json          # Full metadata for all 30 images\n├── download_and_organize.py  # Script to download & organize images\n└── images/\n    ├── img_0001.webp\n    ├── img_0002.webp\n    ├── ...\n    └── img_0030.webp\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨82⟩ Coverage \n###   ⟨83⟩ States/UTs Covered (28+) \nMaharashtra, Karnataka, Delhi, Tamil Nadu, Gujarat, Rajasthan, West Bengal, Telangana, Uttar Pradesh, Kerala, Punjab, Bihar, Odisha, Haryana, Andhra Pradesh, Jharkhand, Madhya Pradesh, Assam, Chhattisgarh, Uttarakhand, Himachal Pradesh, Goa, Jammu & Kashmir, Chandigarh, Sikkim, Meghalaya, Nagaland, Tripura, Manipur\n###   ⟨84⟩ Document Formats   \n| Format  | Count  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| Smart Card (PVC)  | 24  |  \n| Paper Booklet (old format)  | 6  |  \n###   ⟨85⟩ Conditions   \n| Condition  | Count  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| Clean  | 17  |  \n| Worn/Faded  | 2  |  \n| Slightly Aged  | 1  |  \n| Slightly Yellowed  | 1  |  \n| Partial Visible  | 1  |  \n| Blurry  | 1  |  \n| Slightly Crumpled  | 1  |  \n| Slight Glare  | 1  |  \n| Damaged/Worn  | 1  |  \n| In Sleeve  | 1  |  \n| Smudged  | 1  |  \n| Worn/Folded  | 1  |  \n| Damaged/Creased  | 1  |  \n###   ⟨86⟩ Lighting \nStudio, natural, indoor, ambient, fluorescent, dramatic side lighting, scanner, soft, even\n###   ⟨87⟩ Angles \nTop-down, tilted, 45-degree, held in hand, macro closeup, casual, front-and-back\n##   ⟨88⟩ Metadata Fields \nEach image entry in `metadata.json` contains:  \n| Field  | Description  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| `image_id`  | Unique identifier (img_0001 to img_0030)  |  \n| `image_path`  | Relative path to the image file  |  \n| `prompt`  | Full generation prompt  |  \n| `seed`  | Random seed used for generation  |  \n| `state`  | Indian state/UT represented  |  \n| `format`  | Document format (smart_card or paper_booklet)  |  \n| `condition`  | Physical condition of the document  |  \n| `lighting`  | Lighting setup  |  \n| `angle`  | Camera angle  |  \n| `background`  | Background/surface  |  \n##   ⟨89⟩ Generation Details \n  * **Model** : Z-Image-Turbo (8-step diffusion)\n  * **Resolution** : 1024×1024\n  * **Format** : WebP\n\n\n##   ⟨90⟩ Intended Use \nThis dataset is intended for:\n  * Document detection and classification\n  * OCR research on Indian identity documents\n  * Document quality assessment\n  * Synthetic data augmentation for document analysis pipelines\n\n\n##   ⟨91⟩ Limitations \n  * Images are **synthetic** and may not perfectly represent real Indian driving licenses\n  * Text content in images is AI-generated and may not be readable/accurate\n  * The dataset is small (30 images) and should be combined with real data for production use\n  * No personal data of real individuals is contained in this dataset\n\n\n##   ⟨92⟩ License \nCreativeML Open RAIL-M. This dataset is for research and educational purposes only.\n##   ⟨93⟩ Generated by ML Intern \nThis dataset repository was generated by ML Intern⟨97⟩, an agent for machine learning research and development on the Hugging Face Hub.\n  * Try ML Intern: <https://smolagents-ml-intern.hf.space>\n  * Source code: <https://github.com/huggingface/ml-intern>\n\n\n##   ⟨94⟩ Usage \n\n```\nfrom datasets import load_dataset\n\ndataset = load_dataset(\"NIDHISH1980/indian-driving-license-dataset\")\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    63\nNumber of rows: 30 Total file size: 2.28 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨98⟩ Privacy⟨99⟩ About⟨100⟩ Careers⟨101⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
